OL,3,GNEWSADouble murder caught on CCTV, jury
OL,4,Ahears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gunman fired eight shots at a car,
OL,7,Fkilling two men, moments after a parked
OL,8,FAudi was attacked with a hammer and
OL,9,Fmetal bar, a jury has been told.
OL,11,FMohammed Maneer Khan, 39, is accused of
OL,12,Fmurdering Duaine Mills, 28, and Syed
OL,13,FZain Ali, 32, in Harrow Street,
OL,14,FWolverhampton, in the early hours of 19
OL,15,FSeptember last year.
OL,17,FOpening the prosecution case at
OL,18,FWolverhampton Crown Court, Michael
OL,19,FBurrows KC said CCTV showed a man
OL,20,Frunning towards an Audi A4 and opening
OL,21,Ffire as its occupants tried to leave
OL,22,Fthe street.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
